Org12
=====

Stage 12 of the organiser made in the book "Writing Desktop
Applications in JavaScript" (Manuals.JSApps), chapter 12.

This stage adds appointments:
double-click a day to add one, drag one to another day to move it,
and they can repeat. Also the Anniversary section, New entry (or
Insert) and the wastebasket (drag an entry into it).

The finished organiser is !Organiser.
